1
00:00:00,533 --> 00:00:02,533
(Sheldon:)If I were to give you this gift basket...

2
00:00:02,702 --> 00:00:05,032
(Sheldon:)...based on that action alone
and no other data...

3
00:00:05,204 --> 00:00:10,124
(Sheldon:)...infer and describe the hypothetical
relationship that exists between us.

4
00:00:11,544 --> 00:00:12,964
(Assistant:)Excuse me?

5
00:00:13,963 --> 00:00:15,503
(Leonard:)Here.

6
00:00:15,756 --> 00:00:20,136
(Sheldon:)Now are we friends? Colleagues? Lovers?

7
00:00:20,553 --> 00:00:22,223
(Sheldon:)Are you my grandmother?

8
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,140
(Assistant:)I don't understand
what you're talking about...

9
00:00:26,308 --> 00:00:28,938
(Assistant:)...and you're making me
a little uncomfortable.

10
00:00:29,186 --> 00:00:32,066
(Howard:)See? Sounds just like you and Penny.
We'll take it.

11
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:38,860
(David:)Hey, Leonard. Come, join us.

12
00:00:39,029 --> 00:00:42,489
(Leonard:)Oh, hey, Dave. And Penny.
What a surprise.

13
00:00:42,658 --> 00:00:45,198
Hey, Leonard. Dave was showing me
around the university.

14
00:00:45,369 --> 00:00:47,329
(Penny:)You know, this place is unbelievable.

15
00:00:47,496 --> 00:00:50,956
(Leonard:)Yeah, I know. I've been offering
to show you around for a year and a half.

16
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,000
(Leonard:)You always said you had yoga.

17
00:00:53,669 --> 00:00:56,589
- I never said that.
- Maybe I heard you wrong.

18
00:00:56,756 --> 00:01:00,026
A lot of words sound like "yoga."

